OL,3,GNEWSAApprentice Boys banned from
OL,4,Amarching along lower Ormeau Road
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Parades Commission has imposed
OL,7,Frestrictions on an Apprentice Boys
OL,8,Fmarch banning it from entering the
OL,9,Fmainly nationalist lower Ormeau Road.
OL,11,FThe Belfast Walker Club had submitted
OL,12,Fan application for November 7 to parade
OL,13,Ffrom Ballynafeigh Orange Hall along the
OL,14,FOrmeau Road, across Ormeau Bridge and
OL,15,Fonwards to Donegall Pass.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
