OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAApprentice Boys banned from
OL,4,Amarching along lower Ormeau Road
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe commission received submissions
OL,7,Ffrom a number of groups and
OL,8,Findividuals, including the organisers,
OL,9,Fresidents of the lower Ormeau Road and
OL,10,Fthe wider area as well as the Police
OL,11,FService of Northern Ireland (PSNI) and
OL,12,Fpolitical parties.
OL,14,FIt said allowing the march to proceed
OL,15,Falong the proposed route would cause
OL,16,Fsignificant disruption to the local
OL,17,Fcommunity, with the potential for
OL,18,Fdisorder and harm to community
OL,19,Frelations.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
